173 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 116 0 R/E(Spring has officially taken root in Lakewood Village! While many of us are busy tending to our home gardens, nature is putting on its own show along our sidewalks and park strips. This month\220s featured photo showcases a cluster of Hairy Cat's Ear \(Hypochaeris radicata\). Though often mistaken for the common dandelion, these hardy perennials are a distinct sign of the season in our corner of Sunnyvale. Their bright yellow petals perfectly mirror the warmer days coming up.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

